					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-842162#post-2013099</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-842162/null-space#post-2013099</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2014 22:07:07 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>1361261</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Neutral vote. There's a lot of stylistic flourish and heavy use of imagery, which doesn't quite go into the territory of smoke-and-mirrors fuckery that would make me downvote. However, that's a lot of stuff out of the 'ol bag of tricks to use for something as brief as the actual story being told here.</p> <p>On a line-by-line basis, I found it interesting, but there has to be a sense of the whole when writing the piece that I find lacking here.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
